          "check_bonus": "2",
          "defense_type": "DEF",
          "detail": "<p><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/15_RDM/verflare.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"> <strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.NUaxIAIPUu5Qnk8l]{Overflow}</strong></p>\n<p>After this attack is resolved, <strong>Molten Paryashera</strong> select a creature and will perform ⚔️ <strong>Head-On Crash</strong> on the target in its next turn.</p>",
