          "attrib_2": "DEX",
          "basic_name": "⚔️ Hidden Thrashing",
          "check_bonus": "3",
          "defense_type": "DEF",
          "detail": "<p><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/15_RDM/verflare.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"> <strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.NUaxIAIPUu5Qnk8l]{Overflow}</strong></p>\n<p>Can only be used when Molten Paryashera is <strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/09_NIN/shade_shift.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.DMaL1B3Z5Y5AUrvC]{Hidden}</strong>.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>After this attack is resolved, <strong>Molten Paryashera</strong> select an unspecified creature and will perform either ⚔️ <strong>Head-On Crash</strong> or ⚔️ <strong>Head-On Drill</strong> on the target in its next turn.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Molten Paryashera&nbsp;</strong>will stay hidden after this attack.</p>",
