          "attrib_2": "DEX",
          "basic_name": "⚔️ Head-On Crash",
          "check_bonus": "5",
          "defense_type": "DEF",
          "detail": "<p>Can only be used during the turn after ⚔️<strong> Thrashing</strong> was used.</p>\n<p>If the attack hit and the target creature does <strong>NOT</strong> have <strong>physical resistance</strong> or <strong>immunity</strong>, the damage is resolved as if the target creature has <strong>physical vulnerability</strong>.</p>",
