          "attrib_2": "DEX",
          "basic_name": "⚔️ Head-On Drill",
          "check_bonus": "5",
          "defense_type": "DEF",
          "detail": "<p>When this attack hit a creature that is performing <strong>【Guard】</strong>Action, the creature is inflicted with <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Dark.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.IBN7DtvWLFDo8jNh]{Stagger}</strong>.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>When this attack hit a creature that is already <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Dark.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.IBN7DtvWLFDo8jNh]{Stagger}</strong>, inflicts <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Paralyze.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.GqqgHkKOs0hkghdG]{Paralyzed}</strong> instead.</p>",
