      "name": "⭐️ Molten Paryashera",
      "other_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Until the end of the scene, when <strong>Molten Paryashera</strong> attack out of <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/09_NIN/shade_shift.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.DMaL1B3Z5Y5AUrvC]{Hidden}</strong>, its accuracy is increased by <strong>10</strong>.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "other_name": "💥Ambusher's Focus",
          "roll": ""
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p><strong>Molten Paryashera&nbsp;</strong>releases a steam made of hot vapor and earthly particle and a <strong>Molten Steam</strong> clock is placed on the field.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Molten Steam </strong>clock has <strong>6</strong> section and will automatically fill 1 section at the end of each round.<br><br></li>\n<li>When an <strong>air</strong> damage is dealt in the conflict, fill 1 section of <strong>Molten Steam&nbsp;</strong>clock.<br><br></li>\n<li>While <strong>Molten Steam&nbsp;</strong>clock is in the scene, <strong>Molten Paryashera </strong>may perform&nbsp;<strong>Heat Steam&nbsp;</strong>at the start of each round for free.<br><br></li>\n<li>When&nbsp;<strong>Molten Steam&nbsp;</strong>clock is filled, <strong>Molten Paryashera</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>may spend <strong>1 turn activation</strong> to immediately perform the <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/BLU/magic_hammer.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.VCBaZfA3PZzN4sx3]{Massive} Molten Vapor Burst</strong>. Regardless, the <strong>Molten Steam </strong>clock is then removed from the scene.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "other_name": "【💮Zero Power】Molten Steam",
          "roll": ""
        }
      },
