          "details": "<p><strong>【Zero Trigger】</strong></p>\n<p>When any <strong>Head-On</strong> attack hit its target, <strong>Molten Paryashera</strong> fill its&nbsp;<strong>Zero Power Clock&nbsp;</strong>by 3 sections.</p>",
